.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120776","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120776","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120776.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120776.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-16T16:22:29Z"},"body":"When the build profile dialog attempts to load a file but fails, it will show a warning dialog saying it failed. When the editor starts, it tries to load a profile from the get-go, but when that happens the dialog won't show up, throwing an error instead because it's too soon.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes that by making it instead show an toaster instead of a dialog if the profile editor is hidden. This both fixes the issue, and is an UX improvement, since the editor won't throw an dialog at your face at start up.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120776/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120776/time